title: StartScript

---
Eye of Vision: It's cold here.
Eye of Vision: You can't feel anything.
Eye of Sound: You can't hear anything.
Eye of Vision: Have you perished? No... A lost soul would not have been able to gather thought...
Eye of Terror: Is this all there is? All we have in this life? 
Eye of Terror: Are we stuck in limbo for the rest of our life?
Eye of Terror: can't you see? this is all there is to our existence.
Eye of Rage: Lies, all of this.
Eye of Rage: Us, what we are, we could never end up on a place like this.
Eye of Ego: We are the ultimate being, we were not born to spend our lifes in Darkness.
Eye of Vision: Let us focus then.
Eye of Vision: Let's regain control.
Eye of Terror: Let's 
Eye of Rage: Let's
Eye of Sound: Let's
Eye of Choice: Let's
Eye of Vision: Let's
Eye of Lust: Let's
Eye of Vision: View
Eye of Terror: Dread
Eye of Sound: Sound
Eye of Terror: Fright
Eye of Rage: Distress
Eye of Choice: Responsability
Eye of Lust: Desire
Eye of Ego: Meaning
Eye of Vision: Canvas
Eye of terror: Death
Eye of Ego: life
Eye of Terror: Seclusion
Eye of Choice: Learning
Eye of Lust: Copulation
Eyes: Us
Eyes: You
<<jump OutofPod>>
===
title: OutofPod
---
???: Hey, hello?
Eye of Sound: A loud mechanical sound emanates from your current position.
Eye of Vision: The light penetrates through. We appear to be seated on a white Spherical machine.
Eye of : Air and gas releases from the machine.
???: Okay... here we go...
Eye of Sound: Individual, I hear an Individual.
Eye of Sound: Their tone androgynous. Their way of speaking, soft they want us to calm down.
Eye of Choice: Do we speak a word, Vessel?
Eye of Choice: Yes, I refer to you...

    ->Speak up
        <<jump Speakup>>
    ->Say nothing
        <<jump Saynothing>>

===
title: Speakup
---
Eye of Choice: A Choice has been taken.
Eye of Sound: You let out a sound, a feeble moan that echoes through the small sphere.
Eye of Terror: Please hear us, please save us. This mortal body can only live for so long
Eye of Ego: Pathetic, Open this machine, rip it off it's components and regain composture.
Eye of Terror: Do not hear, we are at the disadvantage, we are lost. Pray for survival.
Eye of Vision: you can see the shadow of the Individual, aproaching slowly.


===
title: Saynothing
---
Eye of Choice: A Choice has been taken.
Eye of Sound: Only the sounds of the machine opening fill the area you are in.
Eye of Ego: Good, we do not fright in moments like this, let them aproach you. Let them know you are in control.
Eye of Terror: Your arrogance will be our end. 
Eye of Ego: Do not listen, soon, after we free ourselfs from this prision we will ascend.
===

title: OutofPod2
---
???: Okay, You are okay. Good... Good...
Kala: My name is Kala. Can you hear me okay? How are you feeling?
Eye of Sound: The dreaded Individual shares a piece of her Identity with us.
Eye of Vision: You see this... Kala, They are standing in front of you with a cluster of papers on their hands.
Eye of Lust: You can not control yourself, you analyze their body from head to bottom
Eye of Lust: Their face is beautiful, the way their hair is tied on the back of their head, makes you curious.
Eye of Lust: Their figure is hidden due to a large coat covering their body.
Eye of Lust: Yet you can still see their silhouette. Thin, Curved, Well shaped.
Eye of Lust: Their body leaves a lot to the imagination.  
Eye of Vision: There is a circular symbol on it. A logo, remember it. It may be important.
Eye of Vision: Observing the room you find yourself on an old house full of electronic components.
Eye of vision: Nothing is oganized and you can't tell what's natural and what are electronic components.
Eye of vision: You can't even tell if it's day or night.
Eye of Sound: The machine stops.
Eye of Ego: The time for questions has come.
Eye of Choice: Let's begin then.
Eye of Choice: Vessel?

->Where am I?
        <<jump Whereami>>

->Who am I?
        <<jump whoami>>

->Who are you?
        <<jump whoareyou>>
===
title: Whereami
---
Eye of Choice: A Choice has been taken.
Kala: You are in my house.
Kala: I will answer all your questions in due time.
Kala: Please try to take it slow. This can be very overwelming sometimes.
===
title: whoami
---
Eye of Choice: A Choice has been taken.
Kala: Well, hard question too answer honestly...
Eye of Terror: Why can't she answer us? What is she hiding?
Eye of Terror: Why the secrecy?
Eye of Vision: You appear distressed
Kala: Please Don't be scared, I will help with all I can
Kala: I will answer all your questions in due time.
Kala: Please try to take it slow. This can be very overwelming sometimes.
===
title: whoareyou
---
Eye of Choice: A Choice has been taken.
Kala: I am Kala, I am your proxy. I Will explain what that means in due time.
Eye of Ego: What does proxy mean? Demand an answer, now.
Kala: Please Don't be scared, I will help with all I can
Kala: I will answer all your questions in due time.
Kala: Please try to take it slow. This can be very overwelming sometimes.
===
title: OutofPod3
---
Kala: As i've said. I am Kala. 
Eye of Vision: they grab those papers again, like and puts them in front of them like they are reading a script.
Kala: I've been selected by the state to be your Proxy on your R.A.M process
Kala: R.A.M Stands for "Rehabilitation of Altered Minds".
Kala: The goverment has deemed Your past self as inoperable, thus rendering you inelegible for regular living and assigning you to the R.A.M program which your past self agreed to contribute to...
Eye of Vision: they seem not too worried about following the "Script" You see their eyes speeding through the page.
Kala: Well,Your past emotions were too extreme and you were "Unstable" so the goverment decided to make you... Rest for a while.
Kala: To make sure you are okay during your resting and making sure your emotions calibrate correctly...
Kala: They put you on this pod, which served as a resting point for you while I taked care of you.
Kala: Most citizens have one, ergo most citizens are proxy's. 
Kala: Can I ask how your emotions feel?
Kala: In this documentation it says that the most common side effect is "Various mental monologues" which appear suddendly.
Eye of Sound: They refer to us.
Eye of Ego: Vessel, not a word.
Eye of Ego: The proxy must not know our intentions.
Kala: Well it's just a side effect. 
Eye of Vision: their hand extends to yours.
Eye of Lust: You feel the electric feeling that their human touch brings to your arm.
Eye of Lust: You want that feeling to persevere, you explore their hands. 
Eye of Lust: Soft, clean and beautiful. You want more of them. You want all of them
Eye of Lust: See Vessel? This is the human touch, we must strive for this feeling more often.
Eye of Lust: Let them keep touching you, let them explore all you have in fact.
Kala: I have to tell you something that may be a little extreme.
Kala: The R.A.M program lasts for about 2-6 years.
Kala: You have been in stasis for around 5.
Eye of Terror: Five? Gods that can't be 
Eye of Rage: This can't be. Fling at them now. Kill them if it means we will get the years back.
Eye of Terror: Why can't we remember the years that went past us then? When we were still free of this "Program"?
Eye of Ego: Everything is in control. We do not need our past Unstable self. Fix your posture, we do not need to be afraid. 
Eye of Ego: We are reborn.
Eye of Vision: They see you in distress. 
Kala: You will be okay... You were very young when they brought you here.
Kala: You were 16... So 21 now.
Kala: Are the monologues on effect? You have been fairly quiet. 
Kala: Well it is quite hard to proccess.
Kala: I'm here for anything you need...
Kala: The manuals suggest around 25 minutes before you can walk...
Kala: Is it okay if I check your physique? Is it fine If I touch?
Eye of Lust: You have no saying in this. YES.






===